thrombosis (DVT) one week after
delivery. She is started on enoxaparin. You
are planning to start her on warfarin on
discharge, but the mother is reluctant to take
warfarin because she wants to breastfeed her
baby and she thinks that warfarin may cause
problems to her child. Which of the following
is correct about warfarin and breastfeeding?
