that ‘Doc, | sometimes need to get high on
meth. My favorite wings to fly are cocaine,
though, but since | cannot afford it, | a bit
when | manage to crash a party. She drinks a
bottle of Whisky every day. During the past
few weeks, she has started to worry about
being unable to be a good mother. For this
