presents with a non-reassuring fetal heart rate.
She has a history of a previous C-section and
requires labour induction to benefit the fetus.
Upon assessment, her cervix is posterior and 1
cm dilated, indicating an unfavourable Bishop
score. What is the most appropriate method to
induce labour in this patient?','{"A":"A Administration of oral misoprostol.","B":"B Intravenous oxytocin infusion.","C":"Cc Mechanical cervical dilation using a\nFoley catheter.","D":"D Amniotomy (artificial rupture of\nmembranes).","E":"— Intramuscular administration of\ndinoprostone."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS  (5).pdf","supporting_pages":[2],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-b8b51e50c727","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"253a0b1afafc211bd85f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 OBS  (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS  (5).pdf","source_page":2,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"253a0b1afafc211bd85f","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 OBS  (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS  (5).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":2,"supporting_pages":[2],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Obstetrics","stem":"A 3/-year-old woman at 41 weeks of gestation\npresents with a non-reassuring fetal heart rate.\nShe has a history of a previous C-section and\nrequires labour induction to benefit the fetus.\nUpon assessment, her cervix is posterior and 1\ncm dilated, indicating an unfavourable Bishop\nscore. What is the most appropriate method to\ninduce labour in this patient?","options":{"A":"A Administration of oral misoprostol.","B":"B Intravenous oxytocin infusion.","C":"Cc Mechanical cervical dilation using a\nFoley catheter.","D":"D Amniotomy (artificial rupture of\nmembranes).","E":"— Intramuscular administration of\ndinoprostone."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence